This SDK depends on the third-party software listed in DEPENDENCIES.md. None of it
is redistributed in this repository: protobuf and libcurl are found on the system
through CMake's `find_package` and `pkg-config`, and the generated stubs under
`gen/` are this repository's own protoc output.

## Generated code

`gen/loams/**` is the output of `protoc` (driven by `buf generate --template
buf.gen.yaml`) over this repository's own `proto/` tree, and it is committed so a
consumer needs no `protoc`, no `buf` and no network. Those files are covered by
this notice as part of the SDK.